  "content": "\n\n<p>今天就申請一台伺服器，與你的朋友一起遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅 &amp; 使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/684/717/cbf4e971-7207-4602-bd76-b44081f9b7df.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/字型風格-現代 | 流暢-black?style=plastic\" /> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/gamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/贊助我-支持-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/870825743788158986?color=blue&amp;style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/GamerPotionDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/我的其他-專案-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/申請伺服器-點擊這裡-blue?style=plastic\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: andale mono, monospace;\"><strong>超級 RPG 字型</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">這款現代且獨特的流暢風格字型易於閱讀，將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗。此字型專為 <a style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包打造，現已公開提供給大家使用！<br /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">本字型以 Jovanny Lemonad 設計的熱門 <a style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Russo+One\">Russo One</a> Google 字型為基礎。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">此字型採用開放字型授權（Open Font License）。<br /><br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/634/russo-one-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\" /><br /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: andale mono, monospace;\"><strong>遊戲截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/413/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/414/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/412/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/415/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>點擊下方橫幅今天就申請您的伺服器！或前往 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">BisectHosting.com</a>&nbsp;，並務必使用代碼 '<strong>gamerpotion</strong>' 以享有 25% 折扣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/608/745/bisect-banner-large3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ko-fi.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_bg_tag_dark.png\" width=\"341\" height=\"129\" /></a></p>",
